WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:03.690
<b>The Day After the Fireworks Festival</b>

00:09.220 --> 00:13.910
<i>Sakisaki and Mukai-kun didn't kiss, 
even at the fireworks festival.</i>

00:15.070 --> 00:20.580
<i>I want Mukai-kun and Sakisaki to work out, 
and for him to look only at her.</i>

00:21.640 --> 00:24.100
<i>So why...</i>

00:25.270 --> 00:28.750
I want to give up already.

00:32.220 --> 00:33.720
Give up what?

00:38.260 --> 00:40.100
Sh-Shino-san?

00:41.410 --> 00:44.150
D-Did you see that?

00:45.920 --> 00:47.130
See what?

00:49.510 --> 00:51.330
Wh-What?

00:51.330 --> 00:52.530
What's wrong?

00:53.380 --> 00:54.670
It's nothing.

00:54.670 --> 00:56.270
Y-Yeah?

00:56.740 --> 00:59.690
Hey, is your injury getting better?

00:59.690 --> 01:01.050
Oh, yeah.

01:01.590 --> 01:02.620
Thanks.

01:04.980 --> 01:08.320
Why didn't you kiss yesterday?

01:08.790 --> 01:10.500
K-Kiss you?!

01:10.500 --> 01:12.210
Not me, obviously!

01:12.210 --> 01:14.360
I'm talking about Sakisaki!

01:14.360 --> 01:16.180
Oh, of course.

01:19.720 --> 01:23.140
Well, a lot happened after 
we parted ways with you.

01:23.800 --> 01:25.770
Like, Mirika-san caught me.

01:25.770 --> 01:27.600
Her again?

01:27.600 --> 01:30.080
And Minase-san and I did some stuff.

01:30.080 --> 01:31.610
"Stuff"? With Minase-san?

01:32.610 --> 01:34.320
Did you call me?

01:40.210 --> 01:42.820
What did you do with Mukai-kun yesterday?

01:43.720 --> 01:45.120
Well...

01:49.580 --> 01:50.710
What did you do?!

01:51.100 --> 01:54.890
Y-You didn't get ahead of Sakisaki...

01:56.080 --> 01:58.000
and k-k-iss him, did you?

01:58.000 --> 02:00.140
We didn't k-kiss!

02:00.140 --> 02:01.200
Shino-san!

02:01.200 --> 02:02.720
Then what did you do?!

02:02.720 --> 02:05.520
W-We held hands, and...

02:09.440 --> 02:11.590
Show me how you did it.

02:12.580 --> 02:14.650
Um...

02:16.190 --> 02:17.320
Like this.

02:17.320 --> 02:19.280
The lovers' handhold!

02:19.280 --> 02:22.090
Wh-What else did you do?

02:22.090 --> 02:23.740
You did <i>stuff,</i> didn't you?!

02:23.740 --> 02:25.410
U-Um...

02:25.410 --> 02:26.910
Demonstrate!

02:26.910 --> 02:27.870
Yes, ma'am!

02:27.870 --> 02:30.080
I put my head on his lap...

02:30.380 --> 02:32.040
We did the bridal carry.

02:32.040 --> 02:34.000
And then I grabbed onto him.

02:40.950 --> 02:42.680
Is that everything?

02:43.270 --> 02:45.820
And then we talked together...

02:48.310 --> 02:50.120
and watched the fireworks.

02:53.400 --> 02:58.150
It made for a fantastic memory.

03:01.250 --> 03:02.280
Why...

03:04.180 --> 03:05.450
Why do you...

03:07.200 --> 03:09.370
Don't you ever feel bad for Sakisaki?!

03:10.200 --> 03:11.660
Shino-san...

03:13.540 --> 03:14.680
Stupid!

03:27.190 --> 03:31.540
If it weren't for Minase-san, 
this wouldn't be happening.

03:37.920 --> 03:39.980
If only she weren't here...

03:40.660 --> 03:42.710
Sakisaki would be happy,

03:43.740 --> 03:48.990
<b>Delete?
 Yes No</b>

03:44.660 --> 03:47.500
and I could move on.

03:51.610 --> 03:52.700
It's not fair.

03:56.320 --> 03:57.420
It's not fair.

03:58.120 --> 03:59.300
It's not fair.

03:59.800 --> 04:02.970
It's not fair, Minase-san!

04:07.880 --> 04:11.900
I can't erase him!

04:22.990 --> 04:34.960
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

05:47.670 --> 05:49.030
What the heck?!

05:52.330 --> 05:53.820
"Saki Saki-sama...

05:53.820 --> 05:58.500
Congratulations on winning 
the camping gear set."

05:58.500 --> 06:01.000
Really? Wow!

06:01.000 --> 06:03.140
Did you sign up for something?

06:05.400 --> 06:07.470
I may or may not have.

06:07.470 --> 06:08.800
You don't even know?!

06:09.640 --> 06:12.510
There's even a free campsite coupon!

06:12.800 --> 06:15.640
Looks like it's valid until January 31st.

06:15.640 --> 06:16.970
All right, let's go!

06:18.480 --> 06:24.440
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

06:18.920 --> 06:24.440
A h-hundred and thirty thousand yen 
to lure out a guy she likes...

06:34.600 --> 06:36.660
Look at the view!

06:36.660 --> 06:40.360
And it's the perfect weather 
for a camping trip.

06:40.360 --> 06:44.310
Let's make some more good 
memories and get even closer.

06:44.310 --> 06:45.130
Yes!

06:45.640 --> 06:47.660
Okay, I'm in charge of the tent.

06:47.660 --> 06:49.090
I'll cook.

06:49.440 --> 06:52.780
Man, I actually won 
camping gear in a contest.

06:52.780 --> 06:54.300
I've got some good luck.

06:54.300 --> 06:56.310
You? Lucky?

06:56.710 --> 07:01.440
You're being two-timed, 
and you think you're... lucky?

07:01.440 --> 07:02.770
Hey, Shinosuke!

07:02.770 --> 07:05.730
There are some things you just shouldn't say!

07:08.880 --> 07:11.050
You're just too carefree, Sakisaki.

07:12.040 --> 07:14.580
Are you still going on about 
the fireworks festival?

07:15.090 --> 07:18.160
Who forgets to kiss?

07:19.790 --> 07:22.710
Do you want Minase-san 
to steal Mukai-kun from you?

07:20.770 --> 07:21.720
Everything all right?

07:21.720 --> 07:22.710
Yes.

07:22.990 --> 07:25.210
I-I'm sure it'll be fine.

07:27.480 --> 07:29.910
You really can't be this way.

07:29.910 --> 07:32.930
You don't need to worry so much about me.

07:33.890 --> 07:35.390
Do you...

07:35.390 --> 07:38.350
actually <i>like-like</i> me?

07:38.700 --> 07:40.330
Maybe I ought to hate you.

07:40.330 --> 07:41.560
Please, no!

07:42.100 --> 07:45.100
Oh, Saki-chan, could I ask 
you to get some water?

07:45.100 --> 07:47.120
I'll work on the tent in the meantime.

07:47.120 --> 07:49.060
Sure, I'll go.

07:50.120 --> 07:54.030
Sakisaki, you stay behind to make sure 
Minase-san doesn't do anything out of line.

07:54.400 --> 07:55.830
Shino...

08:09.330 --> 08:11.850
If only Sakisaki would get it together,

08:12.420 --> 08:16.100
I wouldn't have to keep 
thinking about Mukai-kun.

08:22.540 --> 08:24.090
Guess who!

08:25.620 --> 08:28.330
Hey! What do you think you're doing, Sakisaki?!

08:28.330 --> 08:29.500
Nothing.

08:29.500 --> 08:33.030
You just seemed angry...

08:33.030 --> 08:37.490
So I thought if I squeezed your boobs and 
made you horny, it might quell your anger.

08:37.490 --> 08:39.660
I'm not getting horny, 
and it isn't making me less angry!

08:40.130 --> 08:43.770
See, so you <i>are</i> angry.

08:45.040 --> 08:47.080
It's not what you think!

08:49.020 --> 08:51.000
Also, stop squeezing my boobs!

08:51.000 --> 08:53.720
I'm sorry, they're just so comfy.

08:53.980 --> 08:54.930
Jeez!

08:55.290 --> 08:59.180
They're small, but nice and firm!

08:59.180 --> 09:00.870
Stop commentating!

09:03.570 --> 09:05.640
Stop squeezing in silence!

09:06.030 --> 09:09.510
Do I really seem that helpless, though?

09:09.970 --> 09:13.990
You do. What about this situation 
would make me think otherwise?

09:14.900 --> 09:16.950
In any case...

09:17.360 --> 09:19.640
Sorry for making you worry.

09:21.400 --> 09:24.370
Th-Then get it together.

09:24.370 --> 09:26.400
What's this?

09:26.400 --> 09:27.850
Do we have a tsundere here?

09:28.720 --> 09:30.090
Hey!

09:33.320 --> 09:38.680
P-Please! No more! Just stop.

09:40.140 --> 09:44.600
<b>Squish</b>

09:40.140 --> 09:44.600
<b>Squish</b>

09:42.280 --> 09:43.180
Hey!

09:46.510 --> 09:48.200
I told you to give it a rest!

09:48.200 --> 09:50.150
S-Sorry.

09:50.770 --> 09:56.740
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

09:50.770 --> 09:56.740
<b>Hoho...</b>

09:50.770 --> 09:56.740
<b>Mine are still better...</b>

09:50.770 --> 09:56.740
<b>Glare...</b>

09:52.240 --> 09:55.200
Mine are still better.

09:55.200 --> 09:56.740
Glare...

10:01.120 --> 10:03.720
Honestly, you never stop being silly.

10:04.380 --> 10:05.660
Sorry.

10:06.040 --> 10:09.360
You really need to start taking 
Mukai-kun seriously, too.

10:09.360 --> 10:12.840
No, I mean, I am.

10:12.840 --> 10:16.110
You're leaving him alone 
with Minase-san right now!

10:16.110 --> 10:17.420
What are you doing?!

10:18.800 --> 10:23.800
Actually, about that, well...

10:24.770 --> 10:25.970
What?

10:27.000 --> 10:33.190
It kinda seems like you aren't just angry, 
but you have something weighing on you, too.

10:37.380 --> 10:38.860
I couldn't just leave you.

10:39.160 --> 10:40.500
Sakisaki...

10:42.630 --> 10:43.970
Well...

10:43.970 --> 10:45.150
See?

10:45.150 --> 10:47.790
I'm not <i>just</i> stupid, right?

10:48.760 --> 10:51.250
I can always tell when it comes to you.

10:57.600 --> 11:03.050
Are you actually... not that into Mukai-kun?

11:06.530 --> 11:08.230
Naoya's calling.

11:09.390 --> 11:10.920
Hello?

11:12.850 --> 11:13.980
What?

11:14.860 --> 11:17.580
<i>Saki-chan! This is really bad!</i>

11:31.220 --> 11:33.850
The tent's too hard to set up!

11:33.850 --> 11:35.750
I can't start a fire!

11:36.190 --> 11:37.710
That's it?

11:37.710 --> 11:40.090
We'll be sleeping out in the open!

11:40.090 --> 11:41.930
We won't be able to eat!

11:45.250 --> 11:47.130
That's a problem.

11:49.430 --> 11:51.270
Looks like you're in trouble!

11:53.500 --> 11:57.870
Camping super-MeTuber Mirika-sama is here!

11:57.870 --> 11:59.440
Wait...

12:04.960 --> 12:06.580
You build a tent like this!

12:06.580 --> 12:07.580
Like this!

12:07.580 --> 12:08.790
And there!

12:10.200 --> 12:12.250
When you're trying to light the coals,

12:12.250 --> 12:16.470
you have to bunch up the small ones like this, 
stuff a sheet of newspaper inside, and...

12:17.790 --> 12:18.890
there!

12:20.460 --> 12:22.130
And you cook a camp dinner...

12:22.130 --> 12:23.290
like this!

12:24.970 --> 12:28.600
What a coincidence that you'd be here

12:28.600 --> 12:31.200
when we're struggling 
with our first time camping.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.810
Thank goodness!

12:32.810 --> 12:34.870
I know, right?

12:35.770 --> 12:38.400
Wait, what kind of coincidence is that?

12:39.520 --> 12:40.860
You're right!

12:41.460 --> 12:44.080
Did you follow us here?

12:44.080 --> 12:45.700
That took you a while.

12:46.090 --> 12:49.910
I knew you were camping here today.

12:50.480 --> 12:58.250
The free coupon and camp gear you thought 
you got for free was all sent by me!

12:59.520 --> 13:01.710
D-Do you mean...

13:03.830 --> 13:05.180
You're <i>that</i> nice?

13:05.180 --> 13:08.050
No, this has to be some kind of plot!

13:08.050 --> 13:09.140
I see!

13:10.080 --> 13:12.520
But why, Mirika-san?

13:13.200 --> 13:14.100
Why else?

13:14.700 --> 13:16.850
I just wanted to go camping with you.

13:18.940 --> 13:21.230
You never agreed when I asked you.

13:21.910 --> 13:24.780
Would you actually spend 
so much money just for that?!

13:25.580 --> 13:28.240
I want to be out in the 
wilderness with Naoya.

13:28.240 --> 13:32.160
I want us to get closer while
he eats the food I make.

13:32.580 --> 13:35.080
Why wouldn't I do this much?

13:37.290 --> 13:39.290
She's head over heels.

13:40.130 --> 13:41.710
Why?

13:42.680 --> 13:45.080
I pushed you away so strongly.

13:47.580 --> 13:49.550
Here, want some, Saki?

13:49.550 --> 13:51.720
<i>That</i>, I definitely do!

13:52.040 --> 13:52.960
Look out!

13:52.960 --> 13:55.400
She's poisoned me before!

13:55.400 --> 13:56.690
Are you for real?

13:56.690 --> 13:58.440
I remember that.

13:58.440 --> 14:00.960
I didn't lace it this time.

14:00.960 --> 14:02.150
I don't trust her!

14:03.080 --> 14:05.340
I can cook for us!

14:05.340 --> 14:06.610
Nagisa-chan!

14:08.870 --> 14:11.790
We have an awesome chef with us.

14:11.790 --> 14:13.160
Oh?

14:13.980 --> 14:16.710
It's so good, though.

14:19.410 --> 14:20.540
H-Huh?

14:21.480 --> 14:23.140
Here, Risa, have some.

14:25.650 --> 14:26.880
Yum!

14:26.880 --> 14:28.510
They're going for it.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.760
That was good!

14:31.110 --> 14:33.450
But I love pizza!

14:33.450 --> 14:35.060
I know, but...

14:35.060 --> 14:38.580
Nagisa-chan, where's my beautiful camp grub?

14:39.560 --> 14:42.110
W-Well...

14:43.980 --> 14:45.230
It's scorched!

14:45.230 --> 14:47.570
It's so hard to adjust the heat.

14:47.570 --> 14:48.940
I told you.

14:48.940 --> 14:51.530
It's not that easy.

14:51.930 --> 14:52.740
All right.

14:53.020 --> 14:56.080
This camp cooking video got me 
more than 300,000 views!

14:53.490 --> 14:56.080
<b>This MASSIVE Campfire Steak
 Is Bigger than a G-cup</b>

14:59.500 --> 15:04.070
The super-bougie paella I made 
for my 70,000 subscriber video!

15:05.500 --> 15:07.800
And classic curry!

15:10.760 --> 15:12.350
Camp grub...

15:12.350 --> 15:14.460
Saki-chan, stay calm!

15:14.930 --> 15:16.760
You can't match my skill.

15:16.760 --> 15:20.730
Do you have any idea how long 
I've been camping and making videos?

15:26.020 --> 15:28.990
I don't care if she poisons me.

15:29.760 --> 15:30.900
Sakisaki!

15:30.900 --> 15:33.530
I'll even go to bed and get up 
earlier than I normally do!

15:33.530 --> 15:34.700
Say what?!

15:36.410 --> 15:39.500
Mirika-sama, your blessings...

15:39.500 --> 15:41.960
Oh, all right, fine.

15:43.560 --> 15:46.170
But not before Naoya has some first.

15:47.580 --> 15:49.740
I made it for Naoya, after all.

15:49.740 --> 15:51.270
Eat, Naoya.

15:53.860 --> 15:55.130
All right.

16:08.630 --> 16:09.820
It's good.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.330
Right?

16:18.070 --> 16:19.660
All right, I'm eating.

16:19.660 --> 16:21.350
Dig in.

16:21.350 --> 16:22.750
Me, too.

16:22.750 --> 16:25.030
Good for you, Onee-chan.

16:26.680 --> 16:28.880
Yum!

16:28.880 --> 16:30.620
It sure is good.

16:31.680 --> 16:33.540
Have some, Shino.

16:35.990 --> 16:37.390
It's good.

16:37.680 --> 16:39.270
Mirika-san...

16:39.850 --> 16:44.500
How can you be so indifferent

16:45.310 --> 16:48.780
after all I did on the day of the fireworks?

16:49.770 --> 16:53.120
Because, Naoya, you're starting to like me.

16:59.940 --> 17:02.860
A-Are you out of your mind?!

17:02.860 --> 17:03.950
Not really.

17:03.950 --> 17:07.210
I'm just making an objective assessment.

17:07.210 --> 17:09.980
Tell her, Naoya!

17:12.930 --> 17:14.090
Naoya?

17:15.620 --> 17:17.460
That's not something...

17:18.770 --> 17:20.060
I can deny.

17:20.060 --> 17:21.260
Dude!

17:27.650 --> 17:31.610
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

17:31.990 --> 17:36.340
Y-You're... starting to like Mirika?

17:42.740 --> 17:44.470
I knew it!

17:46.850 --> 17:51.450
I just need to keep it up, 
and Naoya will be mine someday!

17:51.450 --> 17:53.840
<i>I love this! I love this! Oh, man!</i>

17:56.490 --> 17:58.470
That won't happen!

17:58.930 --> 18:01.320
I'm just kind of drawn to her!

18:01.320 --> 18:02.390
It's fine!

18:02.720 --> 18:05.350
Nothing about that sounds fine!

18:05.350 --> 18:06.890
Naoya, you idiot!

18:06.890 --> 18:10.110
You poo! You actual poo!

18:10.110 --> 18:11.310
Stop! Saki-chan!

18:12.800 --> 18:17.460
Maybe Naoya gets distracted 
because you're so violent.

18:22.030 --> 18:24.750
I've always been like this to him! It's fine!

18:24.750 --> 18:27.220
Naoya's got bad taste.

18:27.960 --> 18:30.300
H-Hey, Onee-chan?

18:31.110 --> 18:32.420
Yeah, Risa?

18:32.420 --> 18:36.760
Does Naoya-oniichan have a girlfriend?

18:37.360 --> 18:38.460
He sure does.

18:38.460 --> 18:39.530
Me!

18:40.080 --> 18:41.590
M-Me, too!

18:45.830 --> 18:48.770
Oh, I haven't told you, have I?

18:49.250 --> 18:52.300
Naoya's going out with those two.

18:55.710 --> 18:57.800
He's two-timing them with their permission.

18:57.800 --> 19:00.480
With <i>those</i> two, to make it even worse.

19:03.240 --> 19:06.980
You fell in love with a two-timer?

19:06.980 --> 19:09.280
Y-You're making me blush.

19:09.280 --> 19:11.020
I did, but...

19:15.000 --> 19:18.300
And you're trying to take him from them?

19:18.300 --> 19:20.050
Damn right I am!

19:20.680 --> 19:24.970
But even with <i>me</i> asking him out, 
he's not breaking up with them.

19:24.970 --> 19:26.890
He's so stubborn.

19:27.570 --> 19:31.230
Although I like that about him, too.

19:34.630 --> 19:36.440
You moron!

19:36.440 --> 19:38.030
Yeah! Yeah!

19:38.030 --> 19:43.030
You're so cute, you work hard on your videos, 
you're successful, you're nice to me...

19:43.340 --> 19:45.340
You're a good woman!

19:45.340 --> 19:47.850
Go find a better man for yourself!

19:49.200 --> 19:52.000
Naoya's a good guy, even if he's two-timing!

19:52.000 --> 19:54.250
He's a two-timer! That's bad enough!

19:54.250 --> 19:57.340
And what's wrong with you, 
messing with someone else's boyfriend?!

19:57.340 --> 19:58.380
Exactly!

19:58.680 --> 20:02.120
Although, how are you even okay 
with him two-timing you?!

20:02.120 --> 20:04.340
I just got dissed by Risapon.

20:02.680 --> 20:04.340
<b>She likes that she got noticed
by her favorite MeTuber</b>

20:04.820 --> 20:07.580
You're being a nuisance to 
both Sakisaki and Mukai-kun.

20:07.580 --> 20:09.060
Why don't you move on already?

20:09.620 --> 20:11.640
Why would I?

20:12.070 --> 20:13.220
You...

20:13.600 --> 20:18.020
I mean, it's not that I don't feel 
guilty for doing this to you guys.

20:18.880 --> 20:21.660
But what's the point of giving up?

20:27.510 --> 20:31.040
I don't care if Naoya has girlfriends 
or if I'm being a nuisance.

20:31.040 --> 20:33.500
I can't change the fact that I love him.

20:35.960 --> 20:39.300
So all I can do is go on the offensive.

20:39.840 --> 20:46.520
To attack, attack, attack, and break 
down that massive wall someday.

20:51.030 --> 20:55.980
And on that day, I'm taking Naoya from you.

20:58.840 --> 21:02.040
Plus, it looks like there's already 
a crack in that wall.

21:04.000 --> 21:08.180
Th-There's one thing I know for certain now.

21:08.740 --> 21:12.270
We can never let Naoya 
be alone with Mirika again!

21:12.270 --> 21:13.450
Y-You're right!

21:17.780 --> 21:18.940
Girls!

21:18.940 --> 21:19.850
Naoya!

21:19.850 --> 21:20.880
Naoya-kun!

21:21.230 --> 21:25.680
You're going to tell me later what 
happened between you and Mirika.

21:25.680 --> 21:28.430
S-Sure, that's fine...

21:28.850 --> 21:30.810
But hear me out.

21:33.150 --> 21:35.870
It's true that Mirika-san is attractive.

21:35.870 --> 21:38.920
And it's true that I'm kind of drawn to her.

21:39.480 --> 21:43.690
But I'll never do anything to make you two sad!

21:45.150 --> 21:48.630
Because I...

21:51.520 --> 21:52.620
Don't go to sleep!

21:52.910 --> 21:58.220
W-Wait... I'm also... getting...

22:00.680 --> 22:02.470
Mirika, you didn't!

22:05.590 --> 22:06.650
Of course.

22:06.650 --> 22:10.760
In all the pizzas except the first one I ate.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.190
